{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hardwired",
    "steam_appid": 3682210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[BOOT]</strong> <i>Initializing system...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[OS]</strong> <i>Launching terminal...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hardwired</i> is a hacker-themed game set in a retro-cyberpunk setting. Infiltrate networks, manipulate systems and devices through command-line terminals. Unravel the secrets of a dystopian world by exploring digital landscapes, uncovering hidden logs, and piecing together fragmented data to reveal its mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal-Based Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate and manipulate the world entirely through command-line inputs. Execute commands, explore directories, inspect files, and control remote systems with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Network Infiltration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan networks for active IPs, connect via SSH, and dive into remote terminals to access logs, surveillance systems, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story through fragmented logs, system files, and hidden messages scattered across broad networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Driven Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards logic, observation, and curiosity. The more you explore and experiment, the more you'll uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Cyberpunk World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a gritty, low-fi vision of the future, where analog tech meets digital ghosts. CRT-inspired visuals with ASCII GUI, and a sense of eerie isolation await.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[BOOT]</strong> <i>Initializing system...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[OS]</strong> <i>Launching terminal...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hardwired</i> is a hacker-themed game set in a retro-cyberpunk setting. Infiltrate networks, manipulate systems and devices through command-line terminals. Unravel the secrets of a dystopian world by exploring digital landscapes, uncovering hidden logs, and piecing together fragmented data to reveal its mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal-Based Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate and manipulate the world entirely through command-line inputs. Execute commands, explore directories, inspect files, and control remote systems with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Network Infiltration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan networks for active IPs, connect via SSH, and dive into remote terminals to access logs, surveillance systems, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story through fragmented logs, system files, and hidden messages scattered across broad networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Driven Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards logic, observation, and curiosity. The more you explore and experiment, the more you'll uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Cyberpunk World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a gritty, low-fi vision of the future, where analog tech meets digital ghosts. CRT-inspired visuals with ASCII GUI, and a sense of eerie isolation await.</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the terminal and jack into a retro-cyberpunk world. Hardwired is a hacker simulation where you explore networks, uncover secrets, and manipulate systems through command-line interfaces. Discover hidden logs, tap into surveillance feeds, and unravel story a set in a fractured dystopia.",
